{
  "info": {
    "name": "Banglish API - Complete Documentation",
    "description": "Complete API documentation for Banglish Backend\n\n## Authentication\nMost endpoints require JWT authentication. Include the token in the Authorization header:\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer <your-access-token>\n```\n\n## Base URL\n`http://localhost:3000`\n\n## Modules\n1. **Auth** - Registration, Login, OAuth, Password Reset\n2. **Users** - User management (Admin)\n3. **Profile** - User profile & Languages\n4. **Chat** - Direct messages & Group rooms\n5. **Presence** - Online status tracking\n\n## WebSocket\nChat real-time features available at `ws://localhost:3000/chat`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "refreshToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "roomId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🏠 Root",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": [""]
            },
            "description": "Basic health check endpoint. Returns 'Hello World!' if server is running."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🔐 Auth",
      "description": "Authentication endpoints for registration, login, password reset, and OAuth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register (Email)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"profile\": {\n    \"fullName\": \"John Doe\",\n    \"country\": \"Bangladesh\",\n    \"division\": \"Dhaka\",\n    \"district\": \"Dhaka\",\n    \"bio\": \"Hello, I am learning languages!\",\n    \"dateOfBirth\": \"1990-01-15\",\n    \"gender\": \"male\",\n    \"ownLanguage\": \"Bengali\",\n    \"interestedLanguageIds\": []\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Register a new user with email.\n\n**Required:** `email` OR `phone`, `password`\n\n**Optional:** `profile` object with user details"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Register (Phone)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"+8801712345678\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"profile\": {\n    \"fullName\": \"Jane Doe\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Register a new user with phone number."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Email)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', jsonData.accessToken);",
                  "}",
                  "if (jsonData.refreshToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', jsonData.refreshToken);",
                  "}",
                  "if (jsonData.user && jsonData.user.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', jsonData.user.id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login with email and password.\n\n**Response:** `accessToken`, `refreshToken`, `user` object\n\n**Note:** Tokens are automatically saved to collection variables."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Phone)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', jsonData.accessToken);",
                  "}",
                  "if (jsonData.refreshToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', jsonData.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"+8801712345678\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login with phone number and password."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Tokens",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', jsonData.accessToken);",
                  "}",
                  "if (jsonData.refreshToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', jsonData.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Get new access and refresh tokens using a valid refresh token.\n\n**Use when:** Access token expires (401 error)"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Logout current user. Invalidates the refresh token.\n\n**Requires:** Authentication"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot Password (Email)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "forgot-password"]
            },
            "description": "Request password reset. Sends reset token via email.\n\n**Note:** Check server logs for reset token in development."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot Password (Phone)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"+8801712345678\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "forgot-password"]
            },
            "description": "Request password reset via SMS."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"resetToken\": \"your-reset-token-here\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"newpassword123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "reset-password"]
            },
            "description": "Reset password using the token received via email/SMS.\n\n**Password requirements:** Minimum 6 characters"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Auth Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/profile",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "profile"]
            },
            "description": "Get current authenticated user's profile.\n\n**Requires:** Authentication"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Google OAuth (Browser)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/google",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "google"]
            },
            "description": "Initiate Google OAuth flow.\n\n**Usage:** Open this URL in a browser. User will be redirected to Google for authentication.\n\n**Callback:** Redirects to frontend with tokens in URL."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Facebook OAuth (Browser)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/facebook",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "facebook"]
            },
            "description": "Initiate Facebook OAuth flow.\n\n**Usage:** Open this URL in a browser."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "👤 Users (Admin)",
      "description": "User management endpoints. Most require ADMIN role.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Current User",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Get current authenticated user's data.\n\n**Requires:** Authentication"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get All Users (Admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users"]
            },
            "description": "Get list of all users.\n\n**Requires:** ADMIN role"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get User by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/:id",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", ":id"],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "id",
                  "value": "{{userId}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Get a specific user by ID.\n\n**Requires:** Authentication"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create User (Admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"newuser@example.com\",\n  \"passwordHash\": \"hashedpassword\",\n  \"role\": \"user\",\n  \"fullName\": \"New User\",\n  \"country\": \"Bangladesh\",\n  \"isVerified\": true,\n  \"isActive\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new user directly (bypassing registration).\n\n**Requires:** ADMIN role\n\n**Roles:** `user`, `admin`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update User",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"fullName\": \"Updated Name\",\n  \"country\": \"USA\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/:id",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", ":id"],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "id",
                  "value": "{{userId}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Update user data.\n\n**Permissions:** Users can update their own profile. Admins can update any user."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete User (Admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/:id",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", ":id"],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "id",
                  "value": "user-id-to-delete"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Permanently delete a user.\n\n**Requires:** ADMIN role\n\n**Warning:** This is irreversible!"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Deactivate User (Admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/:id/deactivate",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", ":id", "deactivate"],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "id",
                  "value": "user-id-to-deactivate"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Deactivate a user account. User will not be able to login.\n\n**Requires:** ADMIN role"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Activate User (Admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/:id/activate",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", ":id", "activate"],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "id",
                  "value": "user-id-to-activate"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Re-activate a deactivated user account.\n\n**Requires:** ADMIN role"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
